<template><div class="page-wrap"><div class="page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">YOUR COLLECTION</span><h1>我的收藏</h1><p>收藏喜欢的游戏，稍后继续探索。</p></div><div v-if="games.length" class="game-grid"><GameCard v-for="g in games" :key="g.id" :game="g"/></div><div v-else class="empty-state"><span>♡</span><h2>收藏夹还是空的</h2><p>浏览游戏并点击爱心，保存感兴趣的作品。</p><RouterLink to="/games" class="button primary">去发现游戏</RouterLink></div></div></template><script setup>import{inject,computed}from'vue';import GameCard from '../components/GameCard.vue';const data=inject('siteData'),favorites=inject('favorites'),games=computed(()=>data.games.filter(g=>g.published&&favorites.value.includes(g.id)))</script>
